"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 44 of 75 years on record since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 157% of normal in June to July and 6% in February to March. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 20% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 16012 at 30%.</p>"}
